WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.835
- HELLO, LESHAUN.
HELLO, CAROUSEL.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:05.004
- OOH, SAMMY, CAROUSEL
HAD ANOTHER PREMONITION.

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.138
- OH, WHAT WAS IT THIS TIME?

00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:07.240
- SHE SAYS AN OSTRICH

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.774
IS GOING TO ESCAPE
FROM THE ZOO TODAY.

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:10.676
- NOPE, SHE HEARD THAT
ON THE NEWS LAST NIGHT,

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:13.046
SO THAT'S A THING THAT ACTUALLY
HAPPENED IN REAL LIFE ALREADY.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.947
- OKAY, WELL,
BETTER LATE THAN NEVER.

00:00:14.947 --> 00:00:17.083
ALL RIGHT, WELL, GO MAKE DADDY
SOME CHAMOMILE.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.117
LET'S GO. MM.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:20.153
COME ON, GO AROUND.
USE THE FORCE.

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:21.587
THERE YOU GO.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:23.155
- LESHAUN.

00:00:23.155 --> 00:00:24.958
LESHAUN, I JUST GOT THIS LETTER
FROM MY INSURANCE COMPANY.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:28.160
IT LOOKS LIKE WE ARE OFFICIALLY
ON THE SAME INSURANCE.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.395
- WHAT?
- YES.

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:30.630
- [screams]
- YES.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.498
- SAMMY, WE DID IT!
- I CAN'T BELIEVE THIS.

00:00:32.498 --> 00:00:33.767
I MEAN, WE'RE FINALLY

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:35.201
NOT GONNA BE TREATED
LIKE SECOND-CLASS CITIZENS.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.736
- OH, MY GOD, I WANT TO SEE,
I WANT TO SEE, I WANT TO SEE.

00:00:36.736 --> 00:00:38.037
I WANT--NO, DON'T SHOW ME.
JUST TELL ME.

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:39.305
WHAT ARE WE COVERED?
WHAT ARE WE COVERED?

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:40.306
HOW ARE WE COVERED?
- IT'S GOOD INSURANCE.

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.208
WE GET DENTAL AND--
- DENTAL!

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:44.511
OH, MY GOD, MAKE ME
AN APPOINTMENT RIGHT NOW, SAMMY.

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:45.979
- NO, LESHAUN,
YOU GOT TO TAKE IT--

00:00:45.979 --> 00:00:48.815
- I'M GONNA GET A RUBY FILLING
AND A FANG FOR APPLES.

00:00:48.815 --> 00:00:50.983
- A FANG?
- YES, A SINGLE, SOLITARY FANG

00:00:50.983 --> 00:00:52.518
FOR TRICKY FRUITS
AND BOTTLE CAPS.

00:00:52.518 --> 00:00:53.852
- YOU UNDERSTAND THAT THAT'S
KIND OF AN ELECTIVE PROCEDURE,

00:00:53.852 --> 00:00:55.355
WHICH MEANS IT WOULDN'T BE--
- OH, MY GOD.

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:57.624
WELL, I'M GOING TO PROCEED
TO ELECT THE FANG

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.025
THE PRESIDENT OF MY MOUTH.
- OKAY.

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:01.828
- AND THEN I'M GOING
TO GET MY VOICE "LOUDENED"!

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:02.895
- VOICE "LOUDENED."

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:04.230
- YES, SO I CAN...

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.331
♪ TALK TO BIRDS ♪

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:06.799
- ALL RIGHT,
SO, WELL, I DON'T KNOW

00:01:06.799 --> 00:01:08.234
IF WE'RE GOING TO FIND A DENTIST
WHO CAN DO THAT.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.936
ALSO, IT'S NOT COVERED
IN THIS INSURANCE

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:11.237
BECAUSE IT'S THE BASIC...
- UH-HUH, YEAH.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.638
- DENTAL AND VISION.
- UH-HUH.

00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:14.574
VISION!
DID YOU SAY VISION?

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.409
OH, MY GOD.
- I DID SAY VISION.

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:18.011
- SAMMY, SAMMY, SAMMY, SAMMY,
SAMMY, SAMMY, WHAT?

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.779
SAMMY, WHAT? SAMMY!
- THAT IS MY NAME.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.248
- I'M GONNA HAVE ONE CONTACT
THAT LOOKS LIKE A CAT EYE

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.150
AND ANOTHER CONTACT
THAT LOOKS LIKE A CAT'S FACE

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.151
THAT'S MISSING AN EYE.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.653
- YOU DON'T WEAR CONTACTS.

00:01:26.653 --> 00:01:28.154
- I'M GONNA HAVE A THIRD EYE
THAT LOOKS LIKE THE LETTER "I,"

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.889
AND IT'S GONNA BE IN MY EYE,
AND I'M GONNA BE LIKE,

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.358
"I...SEE YOU."

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.193
- [sighs]
LESHAUN...

00:01:34.193 --> 00:01:36.529
YOU DON'T WEAR CONTACTS,
SO THERE'S NO REASON--

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:37.864
- WELL, I'M GOING TO NEED
TO WEAR CONTACTS

00:01:37.864 --> 00:01:39.732
WHEN I HAVE MY EYEBROWS REDID
BECAUSE THEY SAY

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.468
THAT KIND OF PROCEDURE
WILL "SCRUMPLE" THE CORNEAS.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:44.370
- YOU'RE NOT GETTING
YOUR EYEBROWS REDID, REDONE...

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.638
- MM-HMM, MM-HMM, MM-HMM.
- UNDONE, DONE.

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:47.172
- I'M GONNA HAVE 'EM
SWITCHED ON MY FACE,

00:01:47.172 --> 00:01:48.941
SO WHEN I GET MAD,
I LOOK DELIGHTED!

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:50.410
- DO YOU UNDERSTAND
THAT INSURANCE

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.578
IS ONLY
FOR REAL MEDICAL PROBLEMS?

00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:53.946
AND EVEN THEN,
WE HAVE A DEDUCTIBLE.

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:56.082
- I'M GOING TO DEDUCT
THE FAT FROM MY ASS

00:01:56.082 --> 00:01:57.183
AND PUT IT IN MY "FANGLES,"

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.651
SO WHEN I WAVE,
I LOOK LIKE MICKEY MOUSE.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.986
- OKAY, ALL RIGHT.

00:01:59.986 --> 00:02:01.855
LISTEN TO WHAT
I'M TELLING YOU RIGHT NOW.

00:02:01.855 --> 00:02:03.489
- WHAT?
- INSURANCE IS NOT FOR YOU

00:02:03.489 --> 00:02:05.424
TO HAVE THE BOTTOM HALF
OF YOUR BODY CUT OFF

00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:07.694
AND YOU SEWN TO A HORSE
SO YOU CAN EXPERIENCE

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.095
WHAT IT'S LIKE TO BE A...
both: CENTAUR

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:11.163
- OH, MY GOD, SAMMY,
THAT'S A GOOD IDEA.

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:14.099
- IT'S NOT A GOOD IDEA BECAUSE
YOU'D DIE ALMOST IMMEDIATELY.

00:02:14.099 --> 00:02:16.368
- OH, IT'D BE WORTH IT, SAMMY.
IT WOULD BE SO WORTH IT.

00:02:16.368 --> 00:02:18.704
SAMMY, PLEASE,
TELL ME I CAN.

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:21.240
- I KNOW THAT YOU WANT
TO DO THAT, BUT YOU CAN'T DO IT.

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.709
IT'S NOT COVERED
BY THE INSURANCE.

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:25.178
- OH, SAMMY! COME ON!
- IT'S NOT--

00:02:25.178 --> 00:02:27.479
- WHY YOU GOT TO BE THE '80s
TO MY DISCO RIGHT NOW?

00:02:27.479 --> 00:02:29.548
WHY DO YOU HAVE TO, HMM?
- I'M NOT TRYING--

00:02:29.548 --> 00:02:30.984
- YOU DON'T. THAT'S THE ANSWER.
YOU DON'T.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.052
- I'M JUST TRYING TO BE
THE REALITY TO YOUR DEMENTIA.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.520
- I'M GONNA
HAVE TWO STOMACHS!

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:35.788
I'M GONNA GET ANOTHER STOMACH.

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.057
ONE FOR CHERRIES
AND ONE FOR CORN.

00:02:38.057 --> 00:02:39.491
- OH, MY GOD.
- THAT'S RIGHT, SAMMY.

00:02:39.491 --> 00:02:40.693
I'M GONNA GO
TO COUPLES THERAPY ALONE

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:42.061
AND JUST PLAY BOTH PARTS.
- YEAH.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:43.229
- I'M GONNA
GO TO THE GYNECOLOGIST

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.831
AND JUST ASK QUESTIONS
TILL I GET IT.

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.532
OH, AND I GOT
ANOTHER QUESTION--

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:48.234
A FEW QUESTIONS
ABOUT HOW MANY DIFFERENT PARTS

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.469
OF YOUR BODY
YOU CAN MAKE BLINK.

00:02:49.469 --> 00:02:51.403
'CAUSE I WANT TO GET
MY "EARLIDS" DONE

00:02:51.403 --> 00:02:52.772
AND THEN MY FOOT POCKETS.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:55.408
FOOT POCKETS ARE THIS INVENTION
I'VE BEEN THINKING OF...

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:56.742
[hardcore metal music playing]
WHERE YOU CAN JUST PUT...

00:02:56.742 --> 00:02:58.377
YOUR KEYS
UP BY YOUR ANKLES.

00:02:58.377 --> 00:02:59.945
THEN I'M GONNA HAVE A COASTER
PUT IN MY SHOULDER,

00:02:59.945 --> 00:03:01.280
SO WHEN I GO TO A BAR,
I CAN SAY,

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.482
"YOU WANT A DRINK ON ME?"

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:04.249
AND THEN I'M JUST GONNA
BE, LIKE, A MONSTER,

00:03:04.249 --> 00:03:05.685
AND THEN FOR HALLOWEEN,
I'M GONNA DRESS UP

00:03:05.685 --> 00:03:07.153
LIKE A NORMAL HUMAN BEING.

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:10.086
[cheers and applause]
- THANK YOU, EVERYBODY.

